'''Nationals''' (全国大会出場, ''Zenkoku Taikai Shutsujō'', '''Entering Nationals''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (Sm): Slow duration increases by 10%.

